      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "本页由 "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Tiptap"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 管理可编辑内容块。下方依次是图片、音频、视频与互动组件（HTML/CSS/JS 独立沙箱）。按 Ctrl+E 进入编辑模式。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "pageImage",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "./assets/pic.png",
          "caption": "程序生成的测试图片"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "pageAudio",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "./media/narration.wav"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "interactive",
        "attrs": {
          "html": "<style>body{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;text-align:center;padding:14px;color:#1a1c22}</style><h3 style=\"margin:4px 0\">JS 互动：计数器</h3><p id=\"n\" style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:700;margin:4px\">0</p><button onclick=\"document.getElementById('n').textContent=Number(document.getElementById('n').textContent)+1\" style=\"font-size:15px;padding:6px 18px;cursor:pointer\">+1</button><p style=\"color:#888;font-size:12px\">内联脚本运行在沙箱 iframe 中</p>",
          "height": 240,
          "libs": []
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "pageVideo",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "./media/clip.mp4"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "互动块的源码以字符串属性存储，编辑器从不解析或重排它 —— 这就是 \"JS 不被编辑器破坏\" 的关键。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
